{"parse":{"title":"特性/第五灾厄","pageid":7362,"revid":17655,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>第五灾厄</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.AC.AC.E4.BA.94.E7.81.BE.E5.8E.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"第五灾厄\"><b>第五灾厄</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 第五灾厄.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b5/iwrd6y76b6fqm4r2u2dbq881baqgqce.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b5/iwrd6y76b6fqm4r2u2dbq881baqgqce.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b5/iwrd6y76b6fqm4r2u2dbq881baqgqce.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />第五灾厄\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">控制</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">传送</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">击退</span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">打断</span>]，及免疫所有与[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]相关效果。<br />自身防御固定为<font color=\"#ed7950\">100</font>点。每有<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个友军被击败，自身损失对应生命值。<br />每个战斗回合开始时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">烛光</span>]，不可驱散，无法免疫。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%95%99%E7%9A%87%E2%80%9D\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/第五灾厄“教皇”\"><img alt=\"第五灾厄“教皇” 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/n48d9cunkslr1hu0zxctv0s5j11rwwx.png/75px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%95%99%E7%9A%87%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/n48d9cunkslr1hu0zxctv0s5j11rwwx.png/113px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%95%99%E7%9A%87%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/78/n48d9cunkslr1hu0zxctv0s5j11rwwx.png/150px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%94%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C